{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Application Developer"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to describe the application developer job position."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify key information about people's jobs and places of work in spoken or written contexts. Identify key information about people's jobs and places of work in spoken or written contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understand important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.  Exchange simple information on the design of an information system, computer architecture and hardware, and basic concepts on graphic design."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Have Got in Affirmative and Negative"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <b>have got</b> to express possession or obligation. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<b>Have got</b> has the same meaning as the verb <b>to have</b>. However, we use <b>have got</b> when we want to be more formal. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<b>Affirmative form </b>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To make affirmative statements you must follow this structure:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<center>Subject + <b>have/ has got</b> + complement.</center>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: </br><i>I<b> have got</b> a lot of experience in App development. </br>Tom <b>has got</b> some problems with that program.</i>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pay attention to the conjugation of the verb to have in third persons singular."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<b>Negative form</b>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To make negative statements you must follow this structure:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<center> Subject +<b>have/ has</b> + <b>not </b> +<b> got</b> + Complement</center>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: </br><i>I <b>haven't got</b> a lot of experience in App development.</br> Tom <b>hasn't got</b> any problem with that program. </i>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Notice that we generally contract the verb <b>have</b> with the particle <b>not</b> (haven't/hasn't). Let's take a look at the following chart to understand the conjugation of <b>have got.</b> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<center><b>HAVE TO</b></center>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b>Subject>7B>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b>Conjugation</b>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b>Affirmative Contraction</b>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<b>Negative Contraction</b>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">I</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I've got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I haven't got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">You</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You0ve got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You haven't got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">He/ she/ It</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He hasn't got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">We</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We've got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We haven't got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">They</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They've got\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They haven't got\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have got a wide field of application."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have got the possibility to work in mobile phone industry, graphic programs, accounting software and office suits. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I haven't got to make decisions alone since they are very experienced."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quotes About Computers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Technology is everywhere since it simplifies many aspects of the daily life, such as education, business and entertainment. That's why many important intellectuals from different fields state interesting opinions about the influence of technology. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">Read the following quotes, what do you think about them? Do you agree with them? Why?</div>   "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div align=\\\"justify\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">The internet could be a very positive step towards education, organization and participation in a meaningful society.</span></div>      Noam Chomsky\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div align=\\\"justify\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Computers themselves, and software yet to be developed, will revolutionize the way we learn.</span></div>      Steve jobs\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I agree with Steve Jobs when he said  that \u201cComputers themselves, and software yet to be developed, will revolutionize the way we learn\u201d."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "developer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who develops computing programs or applications"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I work as an application developer in a technology computers company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "field"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a particular area to perform an activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Why are you working in this field?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gifted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone skillful at doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think I'm very creative and gifted for this field."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "data-set"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a data collection that is generally tabulated"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm developing a data-set to analyze the output of a program."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "accounting"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "everything related to financial accounts"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have got the possibility to work in the mobile phone industry, graphic software, accounting programs and office suits."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "devise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to plan a strategy to develop something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to consult manuals and technical reports to anticipate future problems and device a solution as soon as possible."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find someone who can talk to you about an application developer. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a brochure explaining the main characteristics of an application developer."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share with a partner. "}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\u274f\tI find someone who can talk to me about an application developer. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u274f \tI make a brochure explaining the main characteristics of an application developer.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u274f\tI use the grammar and the vocabulary related to this lesson and I share my work with a partner.  "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n4le01ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<b>Bob</b>: So, Lucy, tell me about your job.</br><b>Lucy</b>: Well, I work as an application developer in a technology computers company.</br><b>Bob</b>: What duties and responsibilities do you have to fulfill?</br><b>Lucy</b>: I have to adapt software programs into useful applications for business and daily life convenience. I join all the elements of these software programs; then, I establish the program modification I want. Next, I continue with the installing process. And finally, I make a detailed testing of the application.</br><b>Bob</b>: Why are you working in this field?</br>\n<b>Lucy</b>: I think I'm very creative and gifted for this job. Well, even though I haven't got a lot of experience, I consider I'm doing well. And, moreover I agree with Steve Jobs when he said that \u201cComputers themselves, and software yet to be developed, will revolutionize the way we learn\u201d."}, {"time": "48500", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<b>Bob</b>: Wow! What do you have to do in a normal day?</br><b>Lucy</b>: I generally modify programs according to new requirements, and I also evaluate their effectiveness. I have got a great and professional work team, so I haven't got to make decisions alone since they are very experienced.</br><b>Bob</b>: What are you creating now?\n</br>\n<b>Lucy</b>: I'm developing a data-set to analyze the output of a program."}, {"time": "70000", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<b>Bob</b>: Is there enough work in application development?</br><b>Lucy</b>: In fact, I have got a wide field of application. I have got the possibility to work in the mobile phone industry, graphic software, accounting programs, and office suits.</br>\n<b>Bob</b>: I see. I suppose that you need to be updated with everything related to application development.</br><b>Lucy</b>: Exactly! I have to read, study, and keep up to date with each new software or App version. I need to consult manuals and technical reports to anticipate future problems and devise a solution as soon as possible."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about duties and responsibilities related to job positions in IT."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask questions related to App development."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can give information related to application development."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Which phone apps do you use the most? Why?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you know how to create an app? Explain. "}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Do you want to be an application developer?"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Lucy loves her job as an application developer!"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"at